+# 1С guide
+
+MacRunner keeps 1С-style business workloads local and private. Use a dedicated bottle, enable the business profile, keep logs sanitised, and export bug reports as local zip files only.
+
+Keywords: 1С, 1C, business, bottle, registry, fonts.
